- <invariant 1>
- <invariant 2>

## Session log (running notes; one line per session)

- YYYY-MM-DD — worked on / completed / in progress / next priorities

## How to use this file

- adk skills read this at the start of every session (per AGENTS.md §1.2 load order).
- The reading order is: `<repo>/.adk/overrides.yaml` → `<repo>/ai-guidelines/` → `<repo>/docs/` → THIS file → user/company config → constitution.
- If a skill's plan conflicts with a decision logged here, the skill MUST surface the conflict before acting (see `shared/constitution.md` §III.3 — prior decisions inform, never override current intent, but conflicts must be named).
- Add to "Permanent facts" sparingly. Most decisions belong under "Decisions" with a reversibility clause.
